{% comment %}
  F-12/F-28/F-31 Free Shipping Bar, Cart Upsell, Cart Goal Tracker --
  consolidated into one app embed after a merchant asked for something
  simpler than either the app-block system (can't reach a theme's own
  cart drawer, since most themes -- confirmed for Dawn -- don't expose it
  as an app-block-addable section) or full copy-paste code.

  This is a single sitewide app embed (switch on once via Theme Editor >
  App embeds) that looks for three known placeholder classes anywhere in
  the page and renders the matching widget into every element it finds --
  wherever the merchant put them, including pasted directly into
  snippets/cart-drawer.liquid:

    <div class="vantora-shipping-bar"></div>
    <div class="vantora-cart-goal-tracker"></div>
    <div class="vantora-cart-upsell"></div>

  No other code needed in that div. A div for a tool the merchant hasn't
  configured/activated in the app is simply left empty. Classes, not IDs:
  cart drawer markup is typically included globally (present on every
  page, not just /cart), so a merchant who also wants a copy on the
  dedicated cart page ends up with two placeholders in the same page's
  DOM -- IDs must be unique per page and getElementById would only ever
  find the first one, leaving the second silently empty.
  document-wide querySelectorAll finds every instance regardless of
  where in the DOM this embed's own script tag physically renders
  (always sitewide, at the end of body).
{% endcomment %}
<script>
  window.__VANTORA_SETTINGS__ = {
    shipping_bar: {{ shop.metafields.vantora.shipping_bar.value | json }},
    goal_tracker: {{ shop.metafields.vantora.goal_tracker.value | json }},
    cart_upsell: {{ shop.metafields.vantora.cart_upsell.value | json }}
  };
</script>
<script src="{{ 'vantora-analytics.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'vantora-cart.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'vantora-cart-widgets.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Vantora: Cart Widgets",
  "target": "body"
}
{% endschema %}
